---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Resume / CV"
permalink: /resume/index.html
---

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">{{ title }}</h1>

    <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 border-b-2 border-gray-200 pb-2">About</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            Mike Elsmore is a software developer, technologist, public speaker, and community builder who is passionate about developer outreach, education, and open source software. He is driven by the need to get involved with growing communities and with bringing technology to those with an interest or desire to learn.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 border-b-2 border-gray-200 pb-2">Work Experience</h2>

        <div class="space-y-8">
            {% for job in jobs %}
            <article class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                    {% if job.logo %}
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0">
                        <img src="{{ job.logo }}" alt="{{ job.company }} logo" class="w-16 h-16 object-contain rounded">
                    </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    <div class="flex-grow">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-start flex-wrap gap-2">
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">{{ job.title }}</h3>
                                <p class="text-lg text-blue-600 font-medium">{{ job.company }}</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-right">
                                <span class="text-gray-500 text-sm">
                                    {{ job.start_date | date("MMMM YYYY") }} -
                                    {% if job.current or not job.end_date %}
                                        <span class="text-green-600 font-medium">Present</span>
                                    {% else %}
                                        {{ job.end_date | date("MMMM YYYY") }}
                                    {% endif %}
                                </span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        {% if job.description %}
                        <div class="mt-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">{{ job.description | safe }}</div>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 border-b-2 border-gray-200 pb-2">Education</h2>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-medium">Computer Science and International History BSc (Dual) Honours</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">Keele University - 2008</p>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
